### 21\. Recommended implementation milestone

P0 — Protocol Foundation is the recommended starting point.

The first working prototype should demonstrate five things:

* Pseudonymous participant creation.

* Call Card generation, scanning, and revocation.

* Signed World Chat messages.

* Shared Web/Android message schemas.

* Offline peer-to-peer message exchange.

Only after these pass should the project introduce economic settlement and blockchain dependencies.

Engineering recommendation: Establish World Chat as the foundation protocol, with SOS Geocoord, Xenograph Analytics, and the Tri-Layer Integrity Ledger operating as interoperable modules rather than tightly coupled applications.
